                    <span>Years in business</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat" data-animate="fade-up">
                    <strong data-counter data-target="500"
                        data-suffix="+">0</strong>
                    <span>Projects completed</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat" data-animate="fade-up">
                    <strong data-counter data-target="24"
                        data-suffix="/7">0</strong>
                    <span>Customer support hours</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat" data-animate="fade-up">
                    <strong data-counter data-target="98"
                        data-suffix="%">0</strong>
                    <span>Customer satisfaction</span>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="section stock-check"
                aria-labelledby="stock-check-title">
                <div class="stock-content" data-animate="fade-right">
                    <p class="section-kicker">Quick Stock Check</p>
                    <h2 id="stock-check-title">Confirm the right materials
                        before
                        work starts.</h2>
                    <p>Send the product photo, size, and quantity. MAK will help
                        confirm suitable options for pipes, fittings, valves,
                        and
                        drainage materials.</p>
                    <ul class="stock-list">
                        <li>Product type and size</li>
                        <li>Required quantity</li>
                        <li>Delivery location</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a class="button button-primary" href="#contact"
                        data-quote="I need a quick stock check. Product type: Size: Quantity: Delivery location:">Check
                        Availability</a>
                </div>
                <figure class="stock-media" data-animate="fade-left">
                    <img src="images/value.jpg"
                        alt="Valves and fittings ready for project supply"
                        loading="lazy">
                    <figcaption>Fast matching for project materials and
                        replacement orders.</figcaption>
                </figure>
            </section>

            <section id="about" class="section about">
                <figure class="section-media" data-animate="fade-right">
                    <img src="images/about.jpg" alt="Quality plumbing materials"
                        loading="lazy">
                </figure>
                <div class="section-content" data-animate="fade-left">
                    <p class="section-kicker">About Us</p>
                    <h2>Quality materials, fair pricing, reliable service.</h2>
                    <p>MAK provides plumbing products designed for long-term
                        performance. We help contractors, homeowners, and
                        businesses choose the right materials for water
                        networks, drainage systems, and maintenance
                        projects.</p>
                    <a class="text-link" href="#contact">Talk to our team</a>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section id="services" class="section services">
                <div class="section-heading" data-animate="fade-up">
                    <p class="section-kicker">What We Offer</p>
                    <h2>Core plumbing products for every project</h2>
                    <p>Durable products selected carefully for everyday
                        installation and high-demand projects.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="card-grid">
                    <article class="product-card" data-animate="fade-up">
                        <img src="images/pvc.jpg" alt="PVC Pipes"
                            loading="lazy">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h3>PVC Pipes</h3>
                            <p>Lightweight, corrosion-resistant pipes suitable
                                for drainage and water systems.</p>
                            <ul class="product-tags" aria-label="PVC uses">
                                <li>Drainage</li>
                                <li>Lightweight</li>
                                <li>Bulk supply</li>
                            </ul>
                            <a href="#contact"
                                data-quote="I need a quote for PVC pipes and drainage materials.">Request
                                PVC</a>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                    <article class="product-card" data-animate="fade-up">
                        <img src="images/ppr.jpg" alt="PPR Pipes"
                            loading="lazy">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h3>PPR Pipes</h3>
                            <p>Hot and cold water systems with excellent thermal
                                performance and durability.</p>
                            <ul class="product-tags" aria-label="PPR uses">
                                <li>Hot water</li>
                                <li>Cold water</li>
                                <li>Long life</li>
                            </ul>
                            <a href="#contact"
                                data-quote="I need a quote for PPR pipes for hot and cold water lines.">Request
                                PPR</a>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                    <article class="product-card" data-animate="fade-up">
                        <img src="images/value.jpg" alt="Valves and Fittings"
                            loading="lazy">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h3>Valves &amp; Fittings</h3>
                            <p>Reliable valves for controlling water lines in
                                residential, commercial, and industrial
                                settings.</p>
                            <ul class="product-tags"
                                aria-label="Valve and fitting uses">
                                <li>Control</li>
                                <li>Maintenance</li>
                                <li>Replacement</li>
                            </ul>
                            <a href="#contact"
                                data-quote="I need a quote for valves and fittings for a project.">Request
                                Valves</a>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="section process" aria-labelledby="process-title">
