            <section id="faq" class="section faq">
                <div class="section-heading" data-animate="fade-up">
                    <p class="section-kicker">FAQ</p>
                    <h2>Answers before you place an order</h2>
                    <p>Quick details for contractors, developers, and
                        homeowners preparing a materials request.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-list" data-animate="fade-up">
                    <details open>
                        <summary>Can I send a BOQ or product photo?</summary>
                        <p>Yes. Send a bill of quantities, a product photo, or
                            a simple materials list and the team will help match
                            the right items.</p>
                    </details>
                    <details>
                        <summary>Do you support urgent orders?</summary>
                        <p>Urgent and bulk orders can be coordinated by phone or
                            WhatsApp, depending on stock and delivery
                            location.</p>
                    </details>
                    <details>
                        <summary>Can you help choose between PVC and
                            PPR?</summary>
                        <p>Yes. MAK can guide you based on the system type,
                            water temperature, installation environment, and
                            project requirements.</p>
                    </details>
                    <details>
                        <summary>Where do you operate?</summary>
                        <p>The company is based in Itay City, Beheira, and
                            supplies residential, commercial, and industrial
                            projects across Egypt.</p>
                    </details>
                </div>
            </section>

